Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.51,0:00:12.30,Default,Boy,0,0,0,,He... was laughing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.36,0:00:17.66,Default,Boy,0,0,0,,Did we even... do anything wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.01,0:00:22.46,Default,Boy,0,0,0,,Why did he have to come after us?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.24,0:00:24.37,Default,Fushigi,0,0,0,,Because...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.77,0:00:28.41,Default,Fushigi,0,0,0,,you crossed paths.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.86,0:00:30.24,Default,Fushigi,0,0,0,,That's all it took.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.35,0:02:06.33,Signs,text,0,0,0,,EPISODE 7\N A FRENZY OF CRUELTY
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.03,0:02:11.20,Main - Italics,Momo,0,0,0,,Collecting all of the curses in this \Ntown could be backbreaking work.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.20,0:02:15.23,Main - Italics,Momo,0,0,0,,I believe you need a partner. \NI could help you a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.23,0:02:18.65,Default,Fushigi,0,0,0,,Partner? I don't trust you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.65,0:02:22.67,Main - Italics,Momo,0,0,0,,Allow me to guide you. \NFirst, take a left.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.06,0:02:26.96,Main - Italics,Momo,0,0,0,,No, take a left.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.29,0:02:31.91,Default,Sachiko,0,0,0,,Why couldn't we just wait for Dad \Nto get home and take the car instead?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.91,0:02:33.95,Default,Saya,0,0,0,,He said he'd be late tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.95,0:02:37.30,Default,Saya,0,0,0,,Besides, Auntie Ikue will be thrilled \Nwhen we show up with her veggies.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.30,0:02:39.45,Default,Sachiko,0,0,0,,Yeah, but I'm the one \Nstuck carrying them.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.45,0:02:41.80,Default,Saya,0,0,0,,That's because you're so \Nmuch stronger than me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.80,0:02:43.57,Default,Sachiko,0,0,0,,I know, but still...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.57,0:02:46.51,Default,Saya,0,0,0,,Thank you so much, my dear big sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.66,0:02:51.60,Default,Sachiko,0,0,0,,By the way, did you hear about the thing \Nthat happened in the next town over?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.60,0:02:52.89,Default,Saya,0,0,0,,What thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.89,0:02:56.96,Default,Sachiko,0,0,0,,Three college-aged guys \Ngot hurt really bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.96,0:02:58.46,Default,Sachiko,0,0,0,,My friends were talking about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.46,0:03:00.17,Default,Saya,0,0,0,,A car accident or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.17,0:03:03.73,Default,Sachiko,0,0,0,,Nope. It sounds like \Nsomeone attacked them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.73,0:03:06.18,Default,Saya,0,0,0,,Huh? All three of them?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.18,0:03:12.09,Default,Sachiko,0,0,0,,Mom shouldn't send dainty girls to run \Nerrands with stuff like that going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.08,0:03:15.33,Default,Sachiko,0,0,0,,Oh, don't worry! We'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.33,0:03:19.34,Default,Sachiko,0,0,0,,If anyone tries to attack us, \NI'll fend them off myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.34,0:03:20.22,Default,Sachiko,0,0,0,,Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.15,0:03:22.13,Default,Saya,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.59,0:03:29.30,Default,Saya,0,0,0,,Let's take this road instead.\N It's starting to get dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.30,0:03:32.84,Default,Sachiko,0,0,0,,But that's the long way. \NThis way is much faster!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.84,0:03:34.49,Default,Saya,0,0,0,,Yeah, but still...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.49,0:03:36.67,Default,Sachiko,0,0,0,,C'mon, let's get this stuff delivered.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.50,0:03:38.91,Default,Saya,0,0,0,,Okay, fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.70,0:03:43.45,Default,Raita,0,0,0,,You need to stay off this mountain.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.42,0:03:50.40,Default,Saya,0,0,0,,Do you know him, Sis?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.40,0:03:51.99,Default,Sachiko,0,0,0,,No, I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.92,0:03:55.65,Default,Sachiko,0,0,0,,Wait. He's kinda hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.65,0:03:57.07,Default,Saya,0,0,0,,Sis...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.07,0:03:59.85,Default,Sachiko,0,0,0,,What do you mean about staying off it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.85,0:04:04.03,Default,Raita,0,0,0,,If you try to take the mountain path, \Nyou'll be attacked by monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.03,0:04:04.64,Default,Sachiko,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.64,0:04:05.76,Default,Saya,0,0,0,,Monsters?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.76,0:04:08.02,Default,Raita,0,0,0,,You know the rice fields ahead?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.02,0:04:11.11,Default,Raita,0,0,0,,Monsters from urban legends \Nare lurking there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.11,0:04:15.76,Default,Sachiko,0,0,0,,Huh? Um, I don't really \Nunderstand what you mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.76,0:04:18.10,Default,Raita,0,0,0,,They really exist.\N You've got to believe me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.10,0:04:20.36,Default,Sachiko,0,0,0,,But how could we believe that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.35,0:04:24.33,Default,Sachiko,0,0,0,,I mean, have you even seen them yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.33,0:04:26.58,Default,Sachiko,0,0,0,,These... monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.58,0:04:29.94,Default,Raita,0,0,0,,W-Well... no, I haven't.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.94,0:04:31.38,Default,Sachiko,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.38,0:04:34.83,Default,Sachiko,0,0,0,,Oh, I get it. You're just trying \Nto spook us, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.83,0:04:36.21,Default,Raita,0,0,0,,N-No!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.21,0:04:39.47,Default,Raita,0,0,0,,I've never actually seen them, \Nbut I can sense their presence!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.47,0:04:41.13,Default,Sachiko,0,0,0,,What is he talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.13,0:04:42.73,Default,Sachiko,0,0,0,,Saya, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.73,0:04:44.04,Default,Saya,0,0,0,,O-Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.04,0:04:48.35,Default,Raita,0,0,0,,Hey! Stop! I'm telling you \Nthere are monsters out there!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.35,0:04:50.73,Default,Sachiko,0,0,0,,If you get any closer, \NI'm calling the police.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.73,0:04:53.23,Default,Raita,0,0,0,,Wh-Why would you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.23,0:04:55.45,Default,Sachiko,0,0,0,,Obviously because you're a creep!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.45,0:04:57.03,Default,Raita,0,0,0,,I am not a creep!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.03,0:04:58.22,Default,Sachiko,0,0,0,,I'm not kidding. I'll do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.22,0:04:59.82,Default,Raita,0,0,0,,C-Come on...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.82,0:05:00.93,Default,Sachiko,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.45,0:05:05.88,Default,Raita,0,0,0,,W-Well, don't say I didn't warn you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.56,0:05:11.48,Default,Sachiko,0,0,0,,What a jerk! Trying to scare us\N on a dark and spooky path...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.48,0:05:13.31,Default,Sachiko,0,0,0,,I don't care if he's hot.\NThat's just mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.31,0:05:16.07,Default,Saya,0,0,0,,It didn't seem like he was \Nfrom around here, did it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.07,0:05:17.16,Default,Sachiko,0,0,0,,How come?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.16,0:05:22.46,Default,Saya,0,0,0,,Well, he had a big bag on his bike,\N like he'd come from somewhere else.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.32,0:05:25.00,Default,Sachiko,0,0,0,,You could be right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.43,0:05:29.18,Default,Saya,0,0,0,,There's no way monsters \Nactually exist, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.18,0:05:32.74,Default,Saya,0,0,0,,I know he said he could \Nsense them or something...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.74,0:05:33.52,Default,Sachiko,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.52,0:05:37.93,Default,Saya,0,0,0,,But that urban legend stuff... \NI think I've heard about that before.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.93,0:05:40.77,Default,Saya,0,0,0,,That in rice paddies and fields...\N What was it called?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.77,0:05:44.34,Default,Saya,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah. That this monster called \Nthe Wriggler sometimes appears.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.13,0:05:46.78,Default,Saya,0,0,0,,When you see the Wriggler,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.78,0:05:49.92,Default,Saya,0,0,0,,you start to hear a strange sound \Nthat makes your head hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.92,0:05:52.16,Default,Sachiko,0,0,0,,C'mon, let's change the subject.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.16,0:05:56.20,Default,Saya,0,0,0,,You can run, but you'll never get \Naway from it, and then finally...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.12,0:06:00.46,Default,Sachiko,0,0,0,,Aren't you getting scared \Ntalking about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.46,0:06:02.32,Default,Saya,0,0,0,,Yeah, I am kinda scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.32,0:06:04.23,Default,Sachiko,0,0,0,,I told you so.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.16,0:06:12.41,Default,Saya,0,0,0,,Sis, did you hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.41,0:06:13.32,Default,Sachiko,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.32,0:06:15.06,Default,Saya,0,0,0,,You didn't hear anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.41,0:06:17.70,Default,Sachiko,0,0,0,,Did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.70,0:06:19.68,Default,Saya,0,0,0,,Maybe I imagined it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.05,0:06:21.39,Default,Sachiko,0,0,0,,Let's hurry up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.31,0:06:25.74,Default,Saya,0,0,0,,Sis!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.74,0:06:28.33,Default,Sachiko,0,0,0,,I think I did hear something.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.67,0:06:31.33,Default,Saya,0,0,0,,Right? I don't like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.70,0:06:35.57,Default,Saya,0,0,0,,Sis, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.89,0:06:37.79,Default,Sachiko,0,0,0,,It's just a scarecrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.79,0:06:39.78,Default,Saya,0,0,0,,Was there one here before?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.78,0:06:42.25,Default,Sachiko,0,0,0,,You probably just couldn't \Nsee it in the dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.25,0:06:44.90,Default,Saya,0,0,0,,I don't want to go this way!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.69,0:06:48.37,Default,Sachiko,0,0,0,,Fine. I'll go check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.37,0:06:52.90,Default,Saya,0,0,0,,Huh? Wait! Sis! It's too dangerous!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.90,0:06:56.88,Default,Sachiko,0,0,0,,Nah, I'll be fine. There's \Nno such thing as the Wriggler.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.64,0:07:00.59,Default,Sachiko,0,0,0,,See? I was right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.89,0:07:03.31,Default,Sachiko,0,0,0,,Monsters aren't real!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.31,0:07:06.37,Default,Sachiko,0,0,0,,It's only a scarecrow! Come take a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.52,0:07:10.95,Default,Saya,0,0,0,,You're right. It's a scarecrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.95,0:07:12.84,Default,Sachiko,0,0,0,,I told you so.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.54,0:07:15.54,Default,Both,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.54,0:07:16.66,Default,Sachiko,0,0,0,,There's another one?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.66,0:07:17.94,Default,Saya,0,0,0,,Sis!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.94,0:07:19.75,Default,Sachiko,0,0,0,,It must've already been there. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.75,0:07:21.04,Default,Saya,0,0,0,,O-Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.92,0:07:37.52,Default,Sachiko,0,0,0,,Head!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.63,0:07:45.65,Default,Sachiko,0,0,0,,Saya!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.65,0:07:48.18,Default,Saya,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.49,0:07:53.81,Default,Sachiko,0,0,0,,H-Hey! Let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.82,0:07:56.87,Default,Sachiko,0,0,0,,Saya!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.22,0:07:59.24,Default,Sachiko,0,0,0,,We might be in trouble...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.24,0:08:00.17,Default,Raita,0,0,0,,Let them go!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.71,0:08:07.83,Default,Raita,0,0,0,,You creatures do not \Nbelong in this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.84,0:08:08.71,Signs,text,0,0,0,,DESTROY
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.83,0:08:08.99,Default,Raita,0,0,0,,Be destroyed!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.47,0:08:13.63,Default,Raita,0,0,0,,Destroy!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.46,0:08:18.08,Default,Sachiko,0,0,0,,Ouch...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.76,0:08:21.70,Default,Raita,0,0,0,,Destroy! Destroy! Destroy! \NDestroy! Be destroyed!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.70,0:08:23.35,Default,Raita,0,0,0,,Now's our chance! Let's run!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.68,0:08:25.11,Default,Sachiko,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.56,0:08:27.60,Default,Sachiko,0,0,0,,Hey! What were those things?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.60,0:08:31.74,Default,Raita,0,0,0,,I told you there were monsters from \Nurban legends living in the fields!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.74,0:08:33.19,Default,Raita,0,0,0,,That was them!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.81,0:08:34.98,Default,Sachiko,0,0,0,,I still don't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.51,0:08:38.86,Default,Raita,0,0,0,,They just attacked you \Nand you still don't believe me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.86,0:08:41.41,Default,Sachiko,0,0,0,,Was that what they call the Wriggler?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.23,0:08:46.63,Default,Sachiko,0,0,0,,What's the matter? Why are you stopping?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.63,0:08:47.93,Default,Raita,0,0,0,,Did you say the Wriggler?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.93,0:08:50.61,Default,Sachiko,0,0,0,,Back off! Not so close.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.61,0:08:52.03,Default,Raita,0,0,0,,Oh, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.55,0:08:55.31,Default,Raita,0,0,0,,How'd you know about the Wriggler?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.31,0:08:57.47,Default,Sachiko,0,0,0,,Isn't that what those things were?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.47,0:09:00.25,Default,Raita,0,0,0,,Great. So you don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.25,0:09:02.85,Default,Raita,0,0,0,,Those monsters are called \NSinging Scarecrows.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.85,0:09:07.19,Default,Raita,0,0,0,,Singing Scarecrows turn the people they \Nattack into scarecrows like themselves,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.19,0:09:11.20,Default,Raita,0,0,0,,then those new scarecrows try \Nto turn even more people.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.20,0:09:12.36,Default,Saya,0,0,0,,Oh, gosh...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.36,0:09:16.76,Default,Raita,0,0,0,,I've been waiting all week \Nfor the Wriggler to appear,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.76,0:09:19.57,Default,Raita,0,0,0,,but all I got was some Singing Scarecrows.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.00,0:09:21.79,Default,Sachiko,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.70,0:09:26.20,Default,Sachiko,0,0,0,,Didn't you finish them all off?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.20,0:09:28.74,Default,Raita,0,0,0,,The talismans can only \Nstop them temporarily.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.74,0:09:33.03,Default,Raita,0,0,0,,I can sense supernatural beings, \Nbut I can't vanquish them completely.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.03,0:09:36.54,Default,Sachiko,0,0,0,,What?! A minute ago, you were \Nscreaming stuff like, "Be destroyed"!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.54,0:09:39.97,Default,Raita,0,0,0,,I was hoping for the best. \NBeats not trying, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.97,0:09:41.18,Default,Sachiko,0,0,0,,What is wrong with you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.18,0:09:43.18,Default,Saya,0,0,0,,Guys, we don't have time to argue!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.18,0:09:46.15,Default,Sachiko,0,0,0,,More talismans! We can\Nat least slow them down!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.15,0:09:47.49,Default,Raita,0,0,0,,I don't have any more on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.49,0:09:48.59,Default,Sachiko,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.59,0:09:50.55,Default,Raita,0,0,0,,I left the extras in my bag on my bike.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.55,0:09:51.80,Default,Saya,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.80,0:09:53.16,Default,Sachiko,0,0,0,,Go get your bike!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.16,0:09:55.53,Default,Raita,0,0,0,,Not happening. I'm not a fast runner.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.53,0:09:58.48,Default,Raita,0,0,0,,The scarecrows would catch me on the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.48,0:10:01.26,Default,Sachiko,0,0,0,,How can you act so logical \Nat a time like this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.35,0:10:04.47,Default,Raita,0,0,0,,I am still going to save you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.47,0:10:05.91,Default,Raita,0,0,0,,I am not giving up!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.91,0:10:07.00,Default,Sachiko,0,0,0,,But how?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.00,0:10:09.36,Default,Raita,0,0,0,,I don't know. I really don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.36,0:10:12.79,Default,Raita,0,0,0,,But I don't ever want \Nto see another person
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.79,0:10:17.04,Default,Raita,0,0,0,,hurt by monsters again!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.77,0:10:23.05,Default,Fushigi,0,0,0,,If you can't save them, you shouldn't \Nhave gotten involved in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.26,0:10:28.64,Default,Fushigi,0,0,0,,.esruc eht etanimullI
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.09,0:10:30.61,Default,Fushigi,0,0,0,,.esruc eht ebircsnarT
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.81,0:10:33.92,Default,Fushigi,0,0,0,,.tcejorP
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.51,0:10:35.73,Default,Fushigi,0,0,0,,Break!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.32,0:10:36.78,Signs,text,0,0,0,,KAERB
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.20,0:10:40.07,Signs,text,0,0,0,,CURSE
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.33,0:10:48.83,Signs,text,0,0,0,,ESRUC
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.95,0:10:51.88,Default,Sachiko,0,0,0,,He captured them?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.63,0:10:55.71,Default,Saya,0,0,0,,What happens to the people \Nwho were turned into scarecrows?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.71,0:10:57.80,Default,Fushigi,0,0,0,,They're never coming back.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.80,0:10:59.41,Default,Sachiko,0,0,0,,Is there any way to save them?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.82,0:11:03.27,Default,Fushigi,0,0,0,,No. But that's not my problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.61,0:11:04.72,Default,Saya,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.38,0:11:09.31,Default,Raita,0,0,0,,Not your problem, you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.49,0:11:14.35,Default,Raita,0,0,0,,Stop right there, Fushigi Senno!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.90,0:11:18.41,Main - Italics,Momo,0,0,0,,Fushigi-san, do you know that boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.76,0:11:19.94,Default,Fushigi,0,0,0,,Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.94,0:11:21.92,Default,Raita,0,0,0,,My name is Raita Aikawa.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.92,0:11:25.45,Default,Raita,0,0,0,,Fushigi Senno, do you remember this gi—
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.45,0:11:26.95,Default,Raita,0,0,0,,Wh-Wh-Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.78,0:11:31.57,Default,Raita,0,0,0,,Dang it. Hey! Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.98,0:11:33.80,Default,Raita,0,0,0,,S-S-Stop right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.77,0:11:37.06,Default,Raita,0,0,0,,Ow, ouch!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.46,0:11:43.06,Default,Raita,0,0,0,,Get back here!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.72,0:11:48.06,Default,Raita,0,0,0,,Fushigi Senno!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.31,0:12:00.03,Default,Sachiko,0,0,0,,Good morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.49,0:12:06.70,Default,Sachiko,0,0,0,,Oh, I-I'm sorry. It looks like \NI caught you at a bad time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.18,0:12:10.62,Default,Sachiko,0,0,0,,Um, I wanted to thank you for before.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.62,0:12:15.21,Default,Raita,0,0,0,,You don't need to thank me. \NI didn't really do much.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.50,0:12:17.77,Default,Sachiko,0,0,0,,Yeah. That's for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.95,0:12:21.01,Default,Sachiko,0,0,0,,Um, who's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.01,0:12:23.68,Default,Raita,0,0,0,,My little sister. Her name's Natsuna.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.07,0:12:29.30,Default,Raita,0,0,0,,She was attacked by the \NWriggler and went missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.30,0:12:30.05,Default,Sachiko,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.05,0:12:35.01,Default,Raita,0,0,0,,From what I heard, she met Fushigi \NSenno right before it happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.01,0:12:37.86,Default,Sachiko,0,0,0,,Is that why you're looking for him?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.86,0:12:40.41,Default,Raita,0,0,0,,He must know where my sister is now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.72,0:12:44.40,Default,Sachiko,0,0,0,,But he took off without saying a word.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.40,0:12:46.66,Default,Raita,0,0,0,,Yeah, but I still made some progress.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.41,0:12:50.11,Default,Raita,0,0,0,,He was carrying a red notebook. \NYou saw it, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.11,0:12:51.16,Default,Sachiko,0,0,0,,A notebook?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.57,0:12:53.75,Default,Sachiko,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.75,0:12:57.20,Default,Raita,0,0,0,,That notebook seems to have \Nthe power to trap monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.20,0:12:59.97,Default,Sachiko,0,0,0,,Yeah! That's how he captured \Nthose scarecrows!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.97,0:13:04.75,Default,Raita,0,0,0,,I think Natsuna might be \Ntrapped in that notebook, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.75,0:13:05.80,Default,Sachiko,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.80,0:13:08.63,Default,Raita,0,0,0,,And I can still sense \Nan urban legend nearby.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.63,0:13:11.34,Default,Sachiko,0,0,0,,What? You mean there might be \Nmore of those things around?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.34,0:13:15.87,Default,Raita,0,0,0,,Basically, I'm expecting Fushigi Senno \Nto make another appearance soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.87,0:13:17.84,Default,Raita,0,0,0,,That's why I'm still here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.84,0:13:20.26,Default,Sachiko,0,0,0,,I don't wanna see those things again.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.61,0:13:21.96,Default,Raita,0,0,0,,By the way...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.96,0:13:23.92,Default,Sachiko,0,0,0,,Yes, what is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.92,0:13:28.23,Default,Raita,0,0,0,,Do you know if there's, um...\Na bike shop around here?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.23,0:13:29.96,Default,Sachiko,0,0,0,,How come?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.96,0:13:32.34,Default,Raita,0,0,0,,Well, I kinda...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.34,0:13:33.65,Default,Sachiko,0,0,0,,You popped a tire?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.37,0:13:38.35,Default,Sachiko,0,0,0,,Go down that road and \Ntake a right at the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.35,0:13:39.52,Default,Raita,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.57,0:13:46.36,Default,Sachiko,0,0,0,,I guess he isn't so cool after all, \Nbut there's still something about him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.88,0:13:48.63,Signs,text,0,0,0,,TSURUKAME ROAD
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.72,0:13:51.08,Default,Kanon,0,0,0,,Sachiko!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.08,0:13:52.11,Default,Sachiko,0,0,0,,Morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.11,0:13:53.53,Default,Tsubasa,0,0,0,,Morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.53,0:13:57.37,Default,Kanon,0,0,0,,Ahem! New developments have arisen \Nin the case from the nearby town.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.37,0:13:59.63,Default,Tsubasa,0,0,0,,You mean the college \Nguys who got attacked?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.63,0:14:01.05,Default,Kanon,0,0,0,,Yeah, that!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.05,0:14:05.03,Default,Kanon,0,0,0,,It sounds like their injuries \Nwere really nasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.03,0:14:06.10,Default,Sachiko,0,0,0,,Nasty?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.10,0:14:11.86,Default,Kanon,0,0,0,,Yeah! Each of them had exactly \Nthirteen bone fractures.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.86,0:14:14.27,Default,Kanon,0,0,0,,My mom heard about it at work.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.85,0:14:17.58,Default,Tsubasa,0,0,0,,Oh, come on. That sounds \Ncompletely made up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.58,0:14:21.84,Default,Kanon,0,0,0,,It's the truth! And all of them \Nhad the exact same bones broken!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.84,0:14:23.66,Default,Tsubasa,0,0,0,,Yeah, no way.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.18,0:14:27.97,Default,Kanon,0,0,0,,I suspect that it was a curse or \Nsome kind of revenge for something.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.97,0:14:30.12,Default,Kanon,0,0,0,,The number thirteen is \Nsupposed to be unlucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.12,0:14:34.63,Default,Tsubasa,0,0,0,,Yeah, but it wasn't even on the \Nnews, so who knows if it's real?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.63,0:14:36.60,Default,Kanon,0,0,0,,You're missing the point.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.92,0:14:43.68,Default,Kanon,0,0,0,,Lots of crazy stuff happens in the \Nworld that never makes the news.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.68,0:14:46.04,Default,Sachiko,0,0,0,,Never makes the news...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.04,0:14:47.95,Default,Tsubasa,0,0,0,,What's wrong with you, Sachiko?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.95,0:14:51.45,Default,Tsubasa,0,0,0,,You usually call her out and \Nlaugh at her stories with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.45,0:14:56.31,Default,Sachiko,0,0,0,,Well, yeah... but I'm not \Nso sure about this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.31,0:14:57.77,Default,Kanon,0,0,0,,That's what I'm talking about!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.77,0:15:01.78,Default,Kanon,0,0,0,,There's something really creepy \Nand different about this one, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.78,0:15:02.89,Default,Kanon,0,0,0,,Trust me! I can tell!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.89,0:15:05.13,Default,Makoto,0,0,0,,You're still going on about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.15,0:15:10.00,Default,Makoto,0,0,0,,Sakurada, you always get off \Non creeping everyone else out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.00,0:15:14.30,Default,Makoto,0,0,0,,You guys should stop listening to her.\N It's all made up anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.30,0:15:17.62,Default,Kanon,0,0,0,,Huh? I got this directly from my mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.62,0:15:19.81,Default,Kanon,0,0,0,,You calling my mom a liar?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.81,0:15:22.22,Default,Makoto,0,0,0,,N-No, I didn't say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.22,0:15:24.44,Default,Kanon,0,0,0,,Then prove that it's not true.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.44,0:15:25.79,Default,Makoto,0,0,0,,Prove it how?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.36,0:15:28.07,Default,Clown,0,0,0,,Hi!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.61,0:15:33.33,Default,Clown,0,0,0,,Hi!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.33,0:15:34.69,Default,Tsubasa,0,0,0,,It's a clown.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.69,0:15:36.37,Default,Sachiko,0,0,0,,What's a clown doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.53,0:15:39.36,Default,Makoto,0,0,0,,Maybe he's advertising something.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.36,0:15:42.53,Default,Kanon,0,0,0,,Hey, I wasn't done with my story yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.53,0:15:45.51,Default,Makoto,0,0,0,,But c'mon, he might be handing \Nout stuff for free.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.51,0:15:47.04,Default,Kanon,0,0,0,,Why would you think that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.04,0:15:49.80,Default,Makoto,0,0,0,,Because it's probably a promo \Ncampaign for something.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.94,0:15:55.16,Default,Makoto,0,0,0,,I'll go check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.16,0:15:56.73,Default,Kanon,0,0,0,,Hey, get back here!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.73,0:15:58.60,Default,Sachiko,0,0,0,,Kusano, you're gonna be late!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.12,0:16:00.89,Default,Makoto,0,0,0,,I'll be right back!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.17,0:16:03.61,Default,Kanon,0,0,0,,Kusano is such a child, isn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.61,0:16:06.64,Default,Tsubasa,0,0,0,,If he's lucky, he might get a \Nballoon or pack of tissues.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.64,0:16:07.75,Default,Tsubasa,0,0,0,,Let's forget about him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.75,0:16:09.15,Default,Kanon,0,0,0,,We'd better hurry up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.52,0:16:14.45,Main - Top,Teacher,0,0,0,,This is going to be on the \Ntest, so don't forget it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.36,0:16:15.21,Main - Italics,Sachiko (M),0,0,0,,Kusano still hasn't shown up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.95,0:16:17.92,Default,Teacher,0,0,0,,First, take note of this value.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.92,0:16:19.58,Default,Clown,0,0,0,,Hi!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.99,0:16:24.45,Default,Teacher,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Konno?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.97,0:16:28.32,Default,Sachiko,0,0,0,,O-Oh, it's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.74,0:16:31.79,Main - Italics,Sachiko (M),0,0,0,,Whose voice was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.34,0:16:33.73,Main - Italics,Sachiko (M),0,0,0,,The clown's?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.53,0:16:42.34,Default,Teacher,0,0,0,,Class is canceled, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.32,0:16:45.09,Default,Male Student,0,0,0,,Did something happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.09,0:16:47.19,Default,Homeroom Teacher,0,0,0,,There may be a suspicious \Nindividual nearby.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.19,0:16:50.32,Default,Homeroom Teacher,0,0,0,,As best you can, stay in groups\N and head straight home.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.32,0:16:51.75,Default,Homeroom Teacher,0,0,0,,Don't make any stops on the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.06,0:16:56.33,Default,Tsubasa,0,0,0,,What could have made them \Nsend us home early?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.33,0:16:59.57,Default,Kanon,0,0,0,,Yeah, what did he mean by \N"suspicious individual"?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.57,0:17:01.19,Default,Kanon,0,0,0,,Anyway, I guess it's our lucky day!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.19,0:17:02.49,Default,Tsubasa,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.52,0:17:06.03,Default,Tsubasa,0,0,0,,Sachiko, why aren't you happier?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.03,0:17:07.37,Default,Kanon,0,0,0,,Is something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.37,0:17:11.83,Default,Sachiko,0,0,0,,Well, I thought I heard that \Nclown's voice in class.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.83,0:17:15.06,Default,Kanon,0,0,0,,Huh? That's just your imagination.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.06,0:17:17.14,Default,Sachiko,0,0,0,,And Kusano didn't show up at school.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.14,0:17:19.65,Default,Kanon,0,0,0,,Maybe he turned into a clown, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.65,0:17:23.60,Default,Tsubasa,0,0,0,,There you go again. But hey, \Nsince they sent us home early,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.60,0:17:25.56,Default,Tsubasa,0,0,0,,wanna visit the shopping district?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.56,0:17:27.35,Signs,text,0,0,0,,TSURUKAME ROAD
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.53,0:17:27.75,Default,Kanon,0,0,0,,Wanna get a drink?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.75,0:17:28.90,Default,Tsubasa,0,0,0,,Sure, but where?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.90,0:17:30.41,Default,Kanon,0,0,0,,That place we went before!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.41,0:17:33.14,Default,Tsubasa,0,0,0,,Oh, good idea! I'm in the mood \Nfor something sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.14,0:17:34.16,Default,Kanon,0,0,0,,You, Sachiko?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.16,0:17:37.60,Default,Sachiko,0,0,0,,Oh, anywhere is fine with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.60,0:17:39.65,Default,Tsubasa,0,0,0,,Good, then it's settled.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.65,0:17:41.24,Default,Kanon,0,0,0,,Let's go, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.24,0:17:42.11,Default,Tsubasa,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.11,0:17:43.24,Default,Sachiko,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.11,0:17:43.76,Default,Clown,0,0,0,,Hi!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.20,0:17:46.84,Default,Sachiko,0,0,0,,Wasn't that the clown's voice?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.12,0:17:51.00,Default,Clown,0,0,0,,Hi!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.76,0:17:59.20,Default,Trio,0,0,0,,Kusano!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.43,0:18:01.29,Default,Clown,0,0,0,,Hi!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.54,0:18:03.91,Default,Sachiko,0,0,0,,Tsubasa!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.22,0:18:05.41,Default,Clown,0,0,0,,Hi!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.30,0:18:05.41,Default,Sachiko,0,0,0,,Kanon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.35,0:18:12.85,Default,Clown,0,0,0,,Hi!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.37,0:18:19.14,Default,Clown,0,0,0,,Hi!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.00,0:18:25.05,Default,Kanon,0,0,0,,Tsubasa!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.88,0:18:28.91,Default,Sachiko,0,0,0,,Tsubasa! Kanon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.17,0:18:32.38,Default,Sachiko,0,0,0,,Tsubasa!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.19,0:18:34.58,Default,Sachiko,0,0,0,,Tsubasa!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.12,0:18:36.89,Default,Sachiko,0,0,0,,Tsubasa, hang in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.44,0:18:39.80,Default,Sachiko,0,0,0,,Tsubasa! Tsubasa!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.80,0:18:40.83,Default,Raita,0,0,0,,What's wrong?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.69,0:18:43.16,Default,Sachiko,0,0,0,,Raita-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.16,0:18:45.17,Default,Sachiko,0,0,0,,I-It's my friend...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.17,0:18:47.85,Default,Raita,0,0,0,,I could sense a dangerous presence here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.27,0:18:50.31,Default,Raita,0,0,0,,But it looks like I was too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.31,0:18:53.59,Default,Sachiko,0,0,0,,Please stay with Tsubasa. \NI'll call an ambulance!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.59,0:18:54.67,Default,Raita,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.08,0:18:59.22,Default,Sachiko,0,0,0,,Kanon! Wait up!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.22,0:19:00.63,Default,Kanon,0,0,0,,Sachiko!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.73,0:19:03.99,Default,Kanon,0,0,0,,What are we supposed to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.85,0:19:06.93,Default,Sachiko,0,0,0,,The police!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.97,0:19:10.24,Default,Kanon,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.46,0:19:14.93,Default,Sachiko,0,0,0,,Excuse me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.40,0:19:19.14,Default,Sachiko,0,0,0,,Is anyone here?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.69,0:19:21.35,Default,Kanon,0,0,0,,Officer?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.17,0:19:23.70,Default,Sachiko,0,0,0,,Excuse me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.73,0:19:30.57,Default,Sachiko,0,0,0,,Thank goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.92,0:19:33.91,Default,Sachiko,0,0,0,,Please help! There's a weird clown—
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.53,0:19:34.41,Default,Clown,0,0,0,,Hi!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.22,0:19:36.68,Default,Clown,0,0,0,,Hi!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.61,0:19:40.52,Default,Clown,0,0,0,,Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.91,0:19:57.52,Default,Clown,0,0,0,,Hi!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.10,0:19:53.40,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,POLICE BOX
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.18,0:20:02.34,Default,Sachiko,0,0,0,,Kanon!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.06,0:20:12.69,Default,Sachiko,0,0,0,,Enough! Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.60,0:20:14.89,Default,Sachiko,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.74,0:20:21.69,Default,Sachiko,0,0,0,,Kanon! Kanon!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.24,0:20:24.65,Default,Clown,0,0,0,,Hi!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.63,0:20:29.82,Default,Clown,0,0,0,,Hi!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.99,0:20:32.93,Default,Clown,0,0,0,,Hee hee.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.93,0:20:34.45,Default,Raita,0,0,0,,Hey! Over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.25,0:20:37.42,Signs,text,0,0,0,,DESTROY
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.91,0:20:37.20,Default,Raita,0,0,0,,I brought something just for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.89,0:20:39.17,Default,Raita,0,0,0,,Destroy!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.17,0:20:41.53,Default,Raita,0,0,0,,Destroy! Destroy! Destroy! Destroy! \NDestroy! Destroy! Destroy! Destroy!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.53,0:20:44.50,Default,Raita,0,0,0,,Destroy! Destroy! Destroy! \NDestroy! Be destroyed!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.42,0:20:48.65,Default,Clown,0,0,0,,Hi!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.65,0:20:50.14,Default,Clown,0,0,0,,Hi!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.14,0:20:51.19,Default,Sachiko,0,0,0,,Raita-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.19,0:20:52.18,Default,Sachiko,0,0,0,,Raita-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.72,0:20:55.17,Default,Sachiko,0,0,0,,What? No way. Is that it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.17,0:20:57.37,Default,Sachiko,0,0,0,,Wake up! Come on, wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.76,0:21:12.71,Default,Clown,0,0,0,,Hi!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.71,0:21:13.75,Default,Fushigi,0,0,0,,Stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.16,0:21:23.13,Main - Italics,Momo,0,0,0,,Fushigi-san, now's your chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.13,0:21:26.80,Main - Italics,Momo,0,0,0,,The Cruel Clown can't run away \Nwhen he's inside a building.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.80,0:21:28.60,Default,Clown,0,0,0,,Hi!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.61,0:21:35.84,Default,Fushigi,0,0,0,,It's useless. You can shatter \Nevery last bone in my body,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.84,0:21:37.26,Default,Fushigi,0,0,0,,but I'll still collect your curse.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.26,0:21:43.98,Main - Italics,Momo,0,0,0,,Fushigi-san, your tenth rib on \Nthe left side has been broken.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.17,0:21:49.11,Default,Fushigi,0,0,0,,Momo, you said you wanted to help, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.11,0:21:50.04,Main - Italics,Momo,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.04,0:21:51.92,Default,Fushigi,0,0,0,,Then help me this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.57,0:21:55.37,Main - Italics,Momo,0,0,0,,Ouch.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.57,0:21:58.12,Default,Fushigi,0,0,0,,.esruc eht etanimullI
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.12,0:21:59.45,Default,Fushigi,0,0,0,,.esruc eht ebircsnarT
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.89,0:22:04.43,Default,Fushigi,0,0,0,,.tcejorP
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.23,0:22:07.29,Default,Fushigi,0,0,0,,Break!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.76,0:22:08.34,Signs,text,0,0,0,,KAERB
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.34,0:22:12.39,Signs,text,0,0,0,,CURSE
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.44,0:22:22.94,Signs,text,0,0,0,,ESRUC
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.35,0:22:29.19,Default,Sachiko,0,0,0,,But why... Why did it come after us?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.79,0:22:32.99,Default,Fushigi,0,0,0,,Everybody wants to know the \Nanswer to that question...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.01,0:22:35.76,Default,Fushigi,0,0,0,,but there is no reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.21,0:22:37.50,Default,Raita,0,0,0,,Give her back!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.49,0:22:40.61,Default,Raita,0,0,0,,Give Natsuna back to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.73,0:22:47.18,Default,Raita,0,0,0,,Don't go, Fushigi Senno!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.80,0:22:49.55,Default,Fushigi,0,0,0,,I have to get moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.47,0:22:55.10,Main - Italics,Momo,0,0,0,,I am made to perform intellectual labor.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.10,0:22:57.34,Main - Italics,Momo,0,0,0,,How dare you use me like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.06,0:23:01.98,Default,Raita,0,0,0,,Wait. Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.98,0:23:03.85,Default,Sachiko,0,0,0,,Kanon, hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.02,0:23:11.07,Main - Italics,Momo,0,0,0,,With that opponent, it truly \Nwas backbreaking work.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.78,0:23:14.72,Main - Italics,Momo,0,0,0,,And that boy seems very \Ninterested in your notebook.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.72,0:23:18.24,Main - Italics,Momo,0,0,0,,Yet another troublemaker \Nfor you to deal with.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.48,0:23:20.23,Default,Fushigi,0,0,0,,He isn't my problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.80,0:23:24.54,Default,Fushigi,0,0,0,,Momo, I want information \Nfrom you, not opinions.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.54,0:23:26.57,Default,Fushigi,0,0,0,,I still don't trust you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.01,0:25:03.09,Signs,text,0,0,0,,NEXT TIME  \NTHE ROAD TO DESPAIR

